<title>UK: Hill Samuel Asset Management names equities head.</title>
<headline>Hill Samuel Asset Management names equities head.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hill Samuel Asset Management said on Tuesday it had appointed John Ainsworth as head of equities.</p>
<p>The fund management arm of Lloyds TSB Group Plc also named Stewart Cowley as head of global fixed interest, while Peter Baxter will be in charge of asset allocation.</p>
<p>Other appointments are Rupert Della-Porter as senior fund manager for U.S. equities, Sally Hepher as associate director of UK pension funds and Richard Hill as head of performance measurement.</p>
<p>-- Jonathan Thatcher, London Newsroom +44 171 542 7770 (fax +44 171 583 7239)</p>
